%% Sequence Diagram: Youth Account Management API
sequenceDiagram
    participant Parent
    participant UI as Web UI
    participant API as Youth Account API
    participant AccountSvc as Account Service
    participant TxSvc as Transaction Service
    participant PaymentSvc as Payment Service
    participant DB as Youth Account DB
    Note over Parent,UI: OAuth2 authentication, RBAC enforced
    Parent->>UI: Login & OAuth2 Authorization
    UI->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/dashboard
    API->>AccountSvc: Get Account Info
    API->>TxSvc: Get Recent Transactions
    API->>DB: Get Spending Limit
    API-->>UI: Dashboard Data (balance, limit, transactions)
    UI-->>Parent: Show Dashboard
    Parent->>UI: Initiate Fund Transfer
    UI->>API: POST /api/youth-accounts/{id}/fund-transfer
    API->>PaymentSvc: Initiate Fund Transfer
    PaymentSvc-->>API: Transfer Status
    API->>AccountSvc: Update Account Balance
    API->>DB: Update Balance
    API-->>UI: Transfer Result
    UI-->>Parent: Show Transfer Confirmation
    Parent->>UI: Set Spending Limit
    UI->>API: PUT /api/youth-accounts/{id}/spending-limit
    API->>DB: Update Spending Limit
    API-->>UI: Limit Updated
    UI-->>Parent: Show Limit Confirmation
    Parent->>UI: View Transactions
    UI->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/transactions
    API->>TxSvc: Fetch Transactions
    API-->>UI: Transaction List
    UI-->>Parent: Show Transaction History
    Note over API,DB: All actions audit logged
